{"seq":1,"slug":"prokaryotes-bacteria-archaea","title":"原核生物：细菌与古菌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/microbiology/microbial-diversity/prokaryotes-bacteria-archaea","wordCount":2202,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"原核生物-细菌与古菌\">原核生物：细菌与古菌</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>原核生物是地球上最古老、分布最广泛的生命形式，包括细菌域（Bacteria）和古菌域（Archaea）两大谱系。它们缺乏膜包被的细胞核和细胞器，但在代谢多样性和环境适应能力方面远超真核生物。原核生物的生物量占地球总生物量的相当比例，在生物地球化学循环中扮演着不可替代的角色。Carl Woese 于 1977 年基于 16S rRNA 序列分析提出三域系统，将古菌从细菌中独立出来，彻底改变了我们对生命进化树的理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"细菌的细胞结构与功能\">细菌的细胞结构与功能</h2><p>细菌细胞直径通常为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5 - 5\\ \\mu m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，其基本结构包括细胞壁、细胞膜、细胞质和拟核区。细菌细胞壁的组成是分类学的重要标准：革兰氏阳性菌具有厚层肽聚糖（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>80</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 - 80\\ nm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nm</span></span></span></span></span>），而革兰氏阴性菌具有薄层肽聚糖外加外膜结构，外膜含有脂多糖（LPS），是重要的内毒素成分。</p>\n<p>细菌的运动器官包括鞭毛（flagella）、菌毛（pili）和纤毛（fimbriae）。鞭毛由鞭毛蛋白（flagellin）组成，通过质子驱动的分子马达实现旋转运动，转速可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 - 1000\\ rpm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>。趋化系统通过甲基化信号转导级联控制鞭毛马达的旋转方向，使细菌能够感应化学梯度进行定向运动。</p>\n<p>细菌的遗传物质以环状双链 DNA 形式存在于拟核区（nucleoid），不被核膜包裹。典型细菌基因组大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5 - 10\\ Mb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，基因密度高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">85\\% - 95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>，极少含有内含子。许多细菌还携带质粒——小型环状 DNA 分子，编码抗生素耐药性、毒力因子或代谢功能等辅助基因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"细菌的代谢多样性\">细菌的代谢多样性</h2><p>细菌的代谢类型之丰富在所有生命类群中首屈一指。按能量来源可分为光能营养（phototrophy）和化能营养（chemotrophy），按碳源可分为自养（autotrophy）和异养（heterotrophy），由此组合形成四种基本营养类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>营养类型</th>\n<th>能量来源</th>\n<th>碳源</th>\n<th>代表类群</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光能自养</td>\n<td>光</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>蓝细菌、紫硫细菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光能异养</td>\n<td>光</td>\n<td>有机物</td>\n<td>紫色非硫细菌（红假单胞菌）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化能自养</td>\n<td>无机物氧化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>硝化细菌、硫氧化菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化能异养</td>\n<td>有机物氧化</td>\n<td>有机物</td>\n<td>大肠杆菌、芽孢杆菌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种「能源×碳源」的二维矩阵在所有生命中独属原核生物如此完整地占满每一格，是细菌得以殖民几乎所有地球生境的根本原因。</p>\n<p>光合细菌包括含氧光合的蓝细菌（Cyanobacteria）和不产氧光合的紫细菌、绿硫细菌等。蓝细菌的祖先在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 亿年前引发了大氧化事件（Great Oxidation Event），从根本上改变了地球大气组成。化能自养细菌能够氧化无机物（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NH_4^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fe^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）获取能量，驱动氮循环和硫循环的关键步骤。</p>\n<p>厌氧代谢在细菌中同样高度多样化。硫酸盐还原菌利用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SO_4^{2-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1205em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8542em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为末端电子受体，产甲烷古菌将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还原为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CH_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，发酵细菌通过底物水平磷酸化从有机分子中提取能量。这些厌氧过程在缺氧环境（如深海沉积物、沼泽和反刍动物瘤胃）中驱动着碳循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"古菌的独特生物学特征\">古菌的独特生物学特征</h2><p>古菌在细胞结构上与细菌存在根本性差异，尽管两者同为原核生物。古菌细胞膜由异戊二烯醚键脂质组成，而非细菌和真核生物的酯键脂质，这赋予了古菌细胞膜极高的热稳定性和化学稳定性。部分古菌的细胞膜为单层脂质结构（如热球菌目），两个异戊二烯链横跨整个膜，形成更加稳定的结构。</p>\n<p>古菌的细胞壁组成多样，但均不含肽聚糖——某些古菌含有假肽聚糖（pseudopeptidoglycan），甲烷八叠球菌含有杂多糖细胞壁，而部分极端嗜盐古菌则以 S 层蛋白作为唯一的细胞壁成分。</p>\n<p>在分子生物学层面，古菌的信息处理系统（DNA 复制、转录、翻译）与真核生物的相似度明显高于细菌。古菌的 RNA 聚合酶结构复杂度接近真核生物的 RNA Pol II，其核糖体虽为 70S 但对真核翻译抑制剂（如白喉毒素）敏感。这些证据支持古菌与真核生物构成姐妹群的进化关系——2015 年深海沉积物中发现的 Asgard 古菌（Lokiarchaeota 等）携带真核标志蛋白同源基因，进一步将真核生物起源锚定在古菌谱系内部（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/nature14447\">Spang et al., Nature 2015</a>）。</p>\n<p>三域系统与各类群在细胞结构上的根本分野可概括如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  LUCA[最后共同祖先 LUCA] --&gt; BAC[细菌域&lt;br/&gt;酯键膜·肽聚糖壁·细菌型 RNAP]&#10;  LUCA --&gt; ARC[古菌域&lt;br/&gt;醚键膜·无肽聚糖·真核型信息系统]&#10;  ARC --&gt; ASG[Asgard 古菌]&#10;  ASG --&gt; EUK[真核生物&lt;br/&gt;内共生线粒体起源]&#10;  BAC --&gt; CYA[蓝细菌·大氧化事件]&#10;  BAC --&gt; ALP[α-变形菌&lt;br/&gt;→线粒体祖先]&#10;  ALP -.内共生.-&gt; EUK\">graph TD\n  LUCA[最后共同祖先 LUCA] --&gt; BAC[细菌域&lt;br/&gt;酯键膜·肽聚糖壁·细菌型 RNAP]\n  LUCA --&gt; ARC[古菌域&lt;br/&gt;醚键膜·无肽聚糖·真核型信息系统]\n  ARC --&gt; ASG[Asgard 古菌]\n  ASG --&gt; EUK[真核生物&lt;br/&gt;内共生线粒体起源]\n  BAC --&gt; CYA[蓝细菌·大氧化事件]\n  BAC --&gt; ALP[α-变形菌&lt;br/&gt;→线粒体祖先]\n  ALP -.内共生.-&gt; EUK</pre><h2 id=\"极端环境中的原核生物\">极端环境中的原核生物</h2><p>极端微生物（extremophiles）是研究生命极限和生物适应机制的绝佳模型。嗜热菌和超嗜热菌生活在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>122</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60 - 122°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">122°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的高温环境中，其蛋白质通过增加离子键和疏水相互作用、减少空腔体积来维持热稳定性。DNA 拓扑异构酶引入正超螺旋以防止高温下的链解旋。</p>\n<p>嗜盐古菌在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 - 5\\ M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> NaCl 浓度下生长，通过「盐入策略」（salt-in strategy）在细胞内积累 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cl^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来平衡渗透压，其蛋白质表面富含酸性氨基酸以适应高离子强度环境。嗜酸菌（pH <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>）和嗜碱菌（pH <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>）则通过精密的质子泵和膜电位调控维持细胞内中性 pH。</p>\n<p>深海热泉生态系统中的化能自养细菌和古菌构成了独立于光合作用的完整食物网。这些发现不仅拓展了我们对地球生命多样性的认识，也为探索地外生命提供了重要的参考框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原核生物的生态学意义\">原核生物的生态学意义</h2><p>原核生物在全球生物地球化学循环中的作用是不可替代的。氮循环中的固氮作用（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_2 \\rightarrow NH_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、硝化作用（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NH_3 \\rightarrow NO_3^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和反硝化作用（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NO_3^- \\rightarrow N_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）几乎完全由原核生物驱动。碳循环中，蓝细菌贡献了海洋初级生产力的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>，而异养细菌则负责有机物的矿化分解。</p>\n<p>在人体生态系统中，细菌是最主要的共生微生物。人体肠道中栖息着约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{13}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个细菌，其基因组总量（微生物组）约为人体基因组的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。这些共生细菌参与营养物质代谢、维生素合成、免疫系统发育和病原体定殖抵抗等关键生理过程。</p>\n<p>原核生物的多样性认知在宏基因组学时代发生了质的飞跃。环境 DNA 测序揭示了大量未培养微生物类群（如候选门辐射 CPR 和 DPANN 超门），这些微生物可能占细菌和古菌总多样性的一半以上，却因无法在实验室条件下培养而长期被忽视。这一方法学转折的细节见 <a href=\"../microbial-genetics/microbial-evolution-and-phylogeny\">微生物进化与系统发生</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>原核生物分为细菌域和古菌域两大谱系，缺乏膜包被细胞核，但代谢多样性与环境适应力远超真核生物，Carl Woese 的三域系统基于 16S rRNA 将其确立为独立谱系。</li>\n<li>细菌细胞壁的肽聚糖结构（革兰氏阳性厚层 / 阴性薄层加外膜 LPS）是分类与内毒素致病的重要依据；环状拟核 DNA 与质粒共同构成其遗传物质。</li>\n<li>细菌代谢以「能源×碳源」二维矩阵占据几乎所有组合，光合、化能自养与厌氧呼吸驱动氮、硫、碳循环的关键步骤。</li>\n<li>古菌以醚键膜脂、非肽聚糖细胞壁和真核型信息处理系统区别于细菌，Asgard 古菌的证据把真核生物起源锚定在古菌谱系内部。</li>\n<li>极端微生物通过蛋白热稳定化、盐入策略与 pH 调控突破生命极限；宏基因组学揭示了 CPR、DPANN 等大量未培养类群，重塑了原核多样性的认知边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>病毒虽非细胞生物，却是原核生物最重要的捕食者与基因载体：<a href=\"viruses-and-phages\">病毒与噬菌体</a></li>\n<li>真核微生物的细胞器与复杂度对比：<a href=\"fungi-and-protists\">真菌与原生生物</a></li>\n<li>细菌膜与转运的通用机制，参见姊妹 hub：<a href=\"../../cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/membranes-and-transport\">细胞生物学 · 膜与运输</a></li>\n<li>三域系统的进化论框架：<a href=\"../../evolutionary-biology/macroevolution/phylogenetics\">演化生物学 · 系统发生学</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原核生物：细菌与古菌","id":"原核生物-细菌与古菌"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"细菌的细胞结构与功能","id":"细菌的细胞结构与功能"},{"level":2,"text":"细菌的代谢多样性","id":"细菌的代谢多样性"},{"level":2,"text":"古菌的独特生物学特征","id":"古菌的独特生物学特征"},{"level":2,"text":"极端环境中的原核生物","id":"极端环境中的原核生物"},{"level":2,"text":"原核生物的生态学意义","id":"原核生物的生态学意义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"病毒与噬菌体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/microbiology/microbial-diversity/viruses-and-phages"}}